<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>While here below I stay, indeed I know—</l><l>You will return one day; I must all things forgo.</l><l>I set my all on You—You who are true;</l><l>My life is set towards You, e’en the things I’ll do.</l><l>I just see no hope on this dull, dark earth;</l><l>No bright lot in false, fading mirth!</l><l>My hope’s my coming Lord, our destiny—</l><l>Oh, I’m here, Lord, awaiting Thee!</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
